  "description": "Unifyr is the AI-native Partner Relationship Management (PRM) and Channel Sales and Marketing (TCMA) platform for companies running indirect channel programs. This connector gives you direct access to your Unifyr workspace so you can run day-to-day channel operations in natural language.\nWith the Unifyr connector you can: \n- Manage the deal pipeline, register new deals, update stages and values, add contacts and comments, and check deal status.\n- Interact with partners, and handle and route leads.\n- Create and manage marketing campaigns, access all features around channel marketing and search and manage collateral across your content library\n- Get insights about your program performance and predictions for deals and leads\n\nUsing the connector requires a subscription as a supplier or a valid partner account.",
